WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.166
PostgreSQL 19 is

00:00:01.977 --> 00:00:02.437
out

00:00:02.473 --> 00:00:03.463
try it live

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.513
PostgreSQL 19.0 was

00:00:06.325 --> 00:00:09.355
released on 19 November 2026

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:10.652
bringing useful new

00:00:10.464 --> 00:00:12.291
SQL alongside maintenance

00:00:12.103 --> 00:00:13.966
and replication improvements

00:00:14.494 --> 00:00:16.003
Replication experiments

00:00:15.838 --> 00:00:16.710
spin up real

00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:17.736
servers on demand

00:00:18.008 --> 00:00:19.482
a logical subscriber

00:00:19.294 --> 00:00:21.215
on port 5433

00:00:21.263 --> 00:00:22.100
and a physical

00:00:21.911 --> 00:00:24.187
standby on 5434

00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:25.107
fed by the

00:00:24.919 --> 00:00:27.394
primary on 5432

00:00:27.926 --> 00:00:28.869
The tour runs

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:29.506
everything in the

00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:30.543
browser including a

00:00:30.355 --> 00:00:32.076
manual vacuum comparison

00:00:31.888 --> 00:00:33.527
between parallel zero

00:00:33.339 --> 00:00:34.836
and parallel two

00:00:35.358 --> 00:00:36.372
Full story on

00:00:36.183 --> 00:00:37.079
the dashboard
